{"date":"2026-10-08","level":"n4","title":"妹との散歩","text":"今日は天気がよかったので、妹と近くの公園を散歩した。公園では、写真を撮ったり、ベンチで休んだりして、のんびり過ごした。妹は花の名前をたくさん知っていて、本当にびっくりした。少し歩き疲れたのに、妹はまだ遊びたいと言って、なかなか帰ろうとしなかった。結局、二時間近く公園にいて、帰るころには、二人ともすっかり日に焼けてしまった。","tokens":[{"surface_form":"今日","basic_form":"今日","reading":"きょう","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"は","basic_form":"は","reading":"は","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"天気","basic_form":"天気","reading":"てんき","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"が","basic_form":"が","reading":"が","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"よかった","basic_form":"よい","reading":"よかった","pos":"形容詞"},{"surface_form":"ので","basic_form":"ので","reading":"ので","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"妹","basic_form":"妹","reading":"いもうと","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"と","basic_form":"と","reading":"と","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"近く","basic_form":"近く","reading":"ちかく","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"の","basic_form":"の","reading":"の","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"公園","basic_form":"公園","reading":"こうえん","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"散歩した","basic_form":"散歩する","reading":"さんぽした","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"公園","basic_form":"公園","reading":"こうえん","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"で","basic_form":"で","reading":"で","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"は","basic_form":"は","reading":"は","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"写真","basic_form":"写真","reading":"しゃしん","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"撮ったり","basic_form":"撮る","reading":"とったり","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"ベンチ","basic_form":"ベンチ","reading":"ベンチ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"で","basic_form":"で","reading":"で","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"休んだり","basic_form":"休む","reading":"やすんだり","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"して","basic_form":"する","reading":"して","pos